<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 24, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 24, background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 4 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>AI 产品经理实战训练营 · W4D4</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 20, right: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>16 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>第三关 GROUP BY + 第四关 JOIN</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 18, marginBottom: 24 }} />
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B' }}>本页投屏 SQL 环境逐条演示</Text>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 22, width: '100%' }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 12px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace' }}>GROUP BY</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>分组聚合与别名</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>按用户分组算生成次数、采纳次数；<span style={{ fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>AS</span> 起别名；HAVING 是分组后的过滤</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 12px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace' }}>JOIN</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>连表——跨表取数</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>渠道在 users，采纳在 gen_records，靠 <span style={{ fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>ON g.user_id = u.user_id</span> 对上号</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #FCA5A5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px', marginTop: 20 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>投屏错误版本（先跑错，再让学员抓 bug）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#DC2626', fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>SUM(is_accepted) / COUNT(*)  -- 整数除法陷阱：整数除以整数，小数部分直接扔掉，比率全部得 0</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 18, width: '100%' }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B' }}>修正：乘 <span style={{ fontFamily: 'Menlo, monospace', fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>×1.0</span> 变浮点除法——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>比率必乘 1.0，口径必写注释</span></Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 400, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B' }}>学员练习 2、3：分组统计 + 连表算渠道采纳率</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
